  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "e628fba5",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 2.7e — LSTM (history) and LSTM (t only)\n",
    "\n",
    "Same skeleton for every recurrent/feed-forward builder: input `(lookback, n_features)` → layer → `Dense(32, tanh)` → `Dense(6)`, MSE loss on standardised targets. The `seed` argument is honoured so the 5 final refits really differ in initialisation."
   ]
  },
