      "      Attention (t only) | + day-ahead forecast   | val mean CVRMSE 0.0630 | {'units': 48, 'dropout': np.float64(0.35517979609617645), 'lr': 0.0001424557427805268, 'optimizer': 'rmsprop', 'lookback': 1, 'epochs': 54}\n"
