   "source": [
    "MODEL_ORDER = [\"Ridge\", \"RandomForest\", \"HistGB\",\n",
    "               \"LSTM (t only)\", \"GRU (t only)\", \"Attention (t only)\", \"MLP (t only)\",\n",
    "               \"Ridge (hist)\", \"RandomForest (hist)\", \"HistGB (hist)\",\n",
    "               \"LSTM\", \"GRU\", \"Attention\", \"MLP\"]\n",
    "NEURAL_MODELS = [m for m in MODEL_ORDER if m.split(\" \")[0] in NEURAL_BUILDERS]\n",
    "\n",
    "def _fmt(p):\n",
    "    return \", \".join(f\"{k}={v:.3g}\" if isinstance(v, float) else f\"{k}={v}\" for k, v in p.items())\n",
    "\n",
    "params_table = pd.Series(best_params_log).apply(_fmt).unstack().reindex(index=MODEL_ORDER)[list(feature_sets)]\n",
    "display(params_table)\n",
    "print(\"Selected history length (hours) per model x rung:\")\n",
    "pd.Series({k: v[\"lookback\"] for k, v in best_params_log.items()}).unstack().reindex(index=MODEL_ORDER)[list(feature_sets)]"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "56245785",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 2.7m — Seed variability and parameter budget\n",
    "\n",
    "* **Same protocol for every family** — same anchors, same validation dates, same original-units CVRMSE criterion, same refit-on-outer-train rule (2.7).\n",
    "* **Parameter budgets are not equalised.** All neural models search the same `units` range, but that does not give equal parameter counts (the MLP's first layer scales with `lookback × n_features`; attention adds an embedding table and attention weights). The table below makes this visible.\n",
    "* **Seeds.** Every neural entry in `results` is already the **mean over `SEEDS`**; the table below shows mean ± std of the mean CVRMSE across those seeds. The tabular models are deterministic."
   ]
  },
