       "                       no actuators + actuators (current) + actuator history      + cluster + day-ahead forecast\n",
       "Ridge                         5.116                 4.981              4.792          4.762                4.012\n",
       "RandomForest                   4.25                 4.226               4.39           4.35                3.948\n",
       "HistGB                        3.637                 3.632              3.845          3.852                 3.22\n",
